    {
      "id": "claim_45aeba2edc304fceba2fbeb3695822d7",
      "statement": "In contrast to import, conversion/export partitioning never inspects file bytes: partition_games_by_extensions and partition_games_by_all_extensions split games by testing romfile.path.ends_with(extension) against the stored romfiles.path string, and check_roms dispatches on the resolved path's extension. The resulting invariant is that once a file is in the database its recorded extension, not its content, selects the pipeline — a CHD renamed .iso is converted as an ISO.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/check_roms.rs#L136-L203",
