      "id": "claim_9b9d1d5c5f0b427bacfd629db035da18",
      "statement": "ARCHIVE_EXTENSIONS (7z, zip) is the predicate for treating a romfile as a multi-entry container: import_roms unpacks and matches entries individually (also under --extract, via the mimetype extension), rebuild_roms extracts an existing archive before re-importing, check_roms routes to check_archive, and CommonRomfile::get_sorted_path suppresses the per-game arcade subfolder when the extension is an archive.",
