    {
      "id": "claim_b89dcd02f4924aefa250aa94cc6fd501",
      "statement": "NON_ORIGINAL_EXTENSIONS (chd, cso, nsz, rvz, zso, 7z, zip) defines which ROM entries are recompressions rather than catalog originals: import_dats stores original = !NON_ORIGINAL_EXTENSIONS.contains(ext), convert-roms loads its candidates through load_rom_data(..., true) which filters on original = true (export-roms passes false and takes all), and get_sorted_path names a non-original file after the game instead of the DAT rom name. Removing a format from this list would make conversion treat its containers as originals.",
