      "statement": "PS3_EXTENSIONS (pkg, pup, rap) changes how a single-file archive is placed on import: when the matched DAT rom's extension is one of these (or the system is arcade), the extracted file is renamed {game.name}.{archive extension} rather than the rom's own name with the archive extension swapped in.",
