    {
      "id": "claim_afce389600fd41d0b409acac71506f35",
      "statement": "Where the stored extension is insufficient, convert_roms re-queries the mimetype locally: after extracting a single archive entry it overrides the extracted extension with the detected one unless it is iso, then matches iso/rdsk/riff to select CD/HD/LD CHD compression settings; the leftover `others` partition (not archive, CUE/BIN, ISO, CSO, ZSO or CHD) is typed purely by get_mimetype for the same reason, and an unrecognized type prints \"Unsupported file type, skipping\" instead of aborting the run.",
      "evidence": [
