    {
      "id": "claim_0cbecbf73cd9416f99b42790a4c7df43",
      "statement": "Adding a format requires coordinated mimetype.rs edits that the compiler cannot enforce: add the lowercase extension constant, add a length-checked matcher plus a matcher.add registration when magic bytes exist, and update the extension groups downstream dispatch reads (NON_ORIGINAL_EXTENSIONS for recompressions, ARCHIVE_EXTENSIONS for multi-entry containers — which also changes arcade folder placement), then wire import_rom dispatch, check_roms and the partition_games_by_extensions splits in convert_roms/export_roms, which match path string suffixes rather than parsed extensions.",
