      "statement": "Detection is unit-tested per matcher: src/mimetype/test_bps_matcher.rs through test_zso_matcher.rs each assert test_valid (exact magic), test_invalid (right length, wrong bytes) and test_too_short (magic minus one byte), covering the length guard rather than path handling; get_mimetype itself has no direct test and is exercised indirectly by the per-format import tests over fixtures in tests/.",
